   "text": "Budapest Metropolitan University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nBudapest Metropolitan University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBudapest Metropolitan University is the biggest private University in Hungary with a student community of 8,000. BMU have international students from more than 70 countries from all over the world. BMU offers large selection of degree programs offered fully in English which are internationally recognized and highly acclaimed by the business world.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:15\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:15\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nHungary\nYearly Fees\nMax: €6,669.00\nMin: €4,977.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n15%\n1,200 of 8,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2000\nCampus(es)\nBudapest\nCountry\nHungary\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n10/07/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ViJrEA4R1lU\nInternship Details\nInternship available\nAdditional Information\n-",
